    <mxCell id="n2" value="&lt;b&gt;Out&lt;/b&gt;: use case, port, registry, vendor adapter, POS vendor.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In&lt;/b&gt;: POS vendor, partner-adapter, order.requested, Order consumer. A BFF never calls a POS. A domain never exposes a webhook." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
